eLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]咦？这位是……？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[show]（介绍了阿娜洛洁的来头，然后把绝峰之上的事情告诉了希瑟。）[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]唉？原来那里真的曾有过花田……后来被异变破坏了吗……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]对不起……老师。我们没有找到鲜花。现在我们只有这棵仙人球……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]米莉记得前天老师上课时候不太开心。米莉只是想……送给老师一些鲜花，让老师稍微开心一点……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]米莉……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"阿娜洛洁","text":"[show]即使是干旱的岩山，也会有和这些小朋友一样坚韧和温柔的植物哦。这份心意，老师就好好收下吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":570,"transTime":300,"y":-119,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara043_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]米莉，谢谢你。这些仙人球，是老师来巴诺姆村收到过最好的礼物。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]老师……！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]我……确实有些想家了。这么说来……从利特利尔出发，来到驿站那天算起，我已经好多年没有走出深渊了呢。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]在受哈萨琳大人指派，来到巴诺姆村支教前，我还是个吟游诗人呢。即使灾难和异变来临，大家也都非常好学。虽然偶尔会有些寂寞，但老师大部分时间都很开心。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]能看着你们健康成长，老师就很满足了……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]老师……可我们还是没找到鲜花……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]它们就是最美的鲜花。来，老师教你。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara043_1_face_chara043_1a","layer":"chara3"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[show]（老师将仙人球移入一个小盆，做成了一个小盆栽。）[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]哇！好漂亮！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_35"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]你看，就和米莉一样可爱哦。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_36"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]嗯——！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_37"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]现在有几位英雄的功劳，异变的影响也会慢慢褪去吧。等过上几年，山上的花田恢复了，老师再和米莉一起去采花怎么样？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_38"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]嗯！到那时候米莉肯定也长大了，能好好保护老师了！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_39"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]嗯，约好了！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_40"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“老师”希瑟","text":"[show]对了，